<title>UK: Wise Speke seeks London Stock Exchange listing.</title>
<headline>Wise Speke seeks London Stock Exchange listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wise Speke Group Plc, a regional stockbroker, said on Monday it planned to list on the London Stock Exchange this month via a placing.</p>
<p>The float will raise 3.0 million stg after expenses and will value the company at 15.0 million stg.</p>
<p>&quot;A listing on the London Stock Exchange is an important step for Wise Speke,&quot; said chief Executive Nigel Sherlock. &quot;It will help us achieve the objective of developing our services further for the benefit of our growing client base.&quot;</p>
<p>Beeson Gregory will act as sponsor and adviser to the issue.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
